      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "11 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Met up with old friends here and it didn't disappoint us. The ambience is cozy, food is good. The staff is friendly and quick to attend to our need. The parking space is quite spacious.\n\nOrdered Garang Asem here and it tasted authentic.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
