    {
      "name": "places/ChIJ15yoLQD1aS4RM251g2B07Kk/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJN1p1Nm5nRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "This is such a quality restaurant by its food,design,environment...\nI got lunch here...\nThe gezzelig kofta joppie is wonderful...\nContains salad, pickles and onions, fried beef steak & sauce served  with rice...\nDelicious...\nThe uitsmijter also tasty...\nLike English breakfast in Dutch version...\nContains vegetables,fried egg,bread,smoked beef and champignon mushroom... Fried with butter... Amazing...\nThey also give the chilli options too\nThe coffee and flavored rum is like drinking bailey without alcohol and I like it...\nFor this 2 food menu and 1 drink costs only 135 k IDR include the tax & service...\nIt's really worth the quality...\nSatisfying...\nService is quick and polite also kind...\nThe restaurant is clean and comfy also had parking lot for guests too...\nAtmosphere is like in Dutch restaurant,tables and interior,the painting and the flowers even are tulips also had miniature of Holland windmill...",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "This is such a quality restaurant by its food,design,environment...\nI got lunch here...\nThe gezzelig kofta joppie is wonderful...\nContains salad, pickles and onions, fried beef steak & sauce served  with rice...\nDelicious...\nThe uitsmijter also tasty...\nLike English breakfast in Dutch version...\nContains vegetables,fried egg,bread,smoked beef and champignon mushroom... Fried with butter... Amazing...\nThey also give the chilli options too\nThe coffee and flavored rum is like drinking bailey without alcohol and I like it...\nFor this 2 food menu and 1 drink costs only 135 k IDR include the tax & service...\nIt's really worth the quality...\nSatisfying...\nService is quick and polite also kind...\nThe restaurant is clean and comfy also had parking lot for guests too...\nAtmosphere is like in Dutch restaurant,tables and interior,the painting and the flowers even are tulips also had miniature of Holland windmill...",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
