    {
      "name": "places/ChIJ15yoLQD1aS4RM251g2B07Kk/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xsa1FVcFFkRWxYTjFGQmFETmFYekV5YTBaM1dWRRAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "10 months ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "Celebrated my partner’s birthday here and honestly, it was such a memorable experience. Romantic dinner dengan makanan khas Belanda, ambience-nya super aesthetic dan intimate. The service was really friendly and attentive, bikin feel-nya warm banget sepanjang malam. Makanannya? Super enak, no debate, totally worth it. Thank you for making my partner’s birthday dinner so special. Definitely recommended.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "Celebrated my partner’s birthday here and honestly, it was such a memorable experience. Romantic dinner dengan makanan khas Belanda, ambience-nya super aesthetic dan intimate. The service was really friendly and attentive, bikin feel-nya warm banget sepanjang malam. Makanannya? Super enak, no debate, totally worth it. Thank you for making my partner’s birthday dinner so special. Definitely recommended.",
        "languageCode": "en"
